mkdir build
cd build
cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DKDE_INSTALL_USE_QT_SYS_PATHS=ON
make -j$(nproc)
make DESTDIR=~/staging install
cp -r ~/staging/usr/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.kde.plasma.taskmanager/ ~/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.darshancomputing.taskmanager
rm -rf ~/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.darshancomputing.pager
cp -r ~/staging/usr/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.kde.plasma.pager/ ~/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.darshancomputing.pager
rm -rf ~/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.darshancomputing.pager
kquitapp6 plasmashell && kstart plasmashell


When making changes, you need to:

1) Switch back to the default plasmoid
2) Make sure it switched
3) Remove my .local one
4) Restart plasmashell
5) Make sure mine isn't listed as an Alternative
6) build, install, actually install, restart, select alternative, choose mine
